    {
      "end": 25.139999389648438,
      "text": "I can feel my airways, getting crushed in the water waves, lost in your undertow",
      "start": 18.84000015258789
    },
    {
      "end": 29.280000686645508,
      "text": "Baby slurping through the airwaves, and my brain going insane",
      "start": 25.139999389648438
    },
    {
      "end": 32.540000915527344,
      "text": "Love is like a drug coursing through the main vein",
      "start": 29.280000686645508
    },
    {
      "end": 37.220001220703125,
      "text": "We can never be the same, never be the same",
      "start": 32.540000915527344
    },
    {
      "end": 42.41999816894531,
      "text": "Tell me it would be okay",
      "start": 39.900001525878906
    },
    {
      "end": 46.02000045776367,
      "text": "You should tell me I could trust you, be vulnerable",
      "start": 42.599998474121094
    },
    {
      "end": 50.47999954223633,
      "text": "Tell you my inner thoughts, but what did you do to me?",
      "start": 46.02000045776367
    },
    {
      "end": 53.65999984741211,
      "text": "Now you're sitting back, looking at me like I'm a disease",
      "start": 50.540000915527344
    },
    {
      "end": 56.81999969482422,
      "text": "Like I did something wrong, bitch, sneeze",
      "start": 53.65999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 60.099998474121094,
      "text": "There's no allergy here, it's calling in your mind",
      "start": 56.81999969482422
    },
    {
      "end": 64.05999755859375,
      "text": "Thinking I'm something lost, when I'm just telling you the thoughts",
      "start": 60.099998474121094
    },
    {
      "end": 66.33999633789062,
      "text": "In the undertow of all life",
      "start": 64.05999755859375
    },
    {
      "end": 69.55999755859375,
      "text": "You're gonna judge me, you want my fucking life",
      "start": 66.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 73.5999984741211,
      "text": "Fucking bitch, sorry it gets this way",
      "start": 69.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 76.13999938964844,
      "text": "But I gotta tell you no way",
      "start": 73.5999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 84.5,
      "text": "I don't want to do this shit ever again, ever again",
      "start": 77.19999694824219
    },
    {
      "end": 88.18000030517578,
      "text": "Driving me away",
      "start": 85.5999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 94.5199966430664,
      "text": "I can feel my airways, getting crushed in the water waves, lost in your undertow",
      "start": 88.18000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 100.91999816894531,
      "text": "I can feel my airways, getting crushed in the water waves, lost in your undertow",
      "start": 94.5199966430664
    },
    {
      "end": 105,
      "text": "Baby surfing through the airwaves, see my brain going insane",
      "start": 100.91999816894531
    },
    {
      "end": 108.30000305175781,
      "text": "Love is like a drug coursing through the main vein",
      "start": 105.0999984741211
    },
    {
      "end": 114.05999755859375,
      "text": "We can never be the same, yeah",
      "start": 108.30000305175781
    },
    {
      "end": 120.45999908447266,
      "text": "Mayday, mayday, I'm the forecast, it's only pain, everyday never change",
      "start": 115.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 122.66000366210938,
      "text": "I work in no place, kinda lame",
      "start": 120.4800033569336
    },
    {
      "end": 128.75999450683594,
      "text": "What do you say, break the mold, come out and play",
      "start": 126.0199966430664
    },
    {
      "end": 134.36000061035156,
      "text": "It's a great day, light rays touch my face, warm my soul, going cold, there's no way, no",
      "start": 128.75999450683594
    },
    {
      "end": 138.05999755859375,
      "text": "Don't you know, no, oh, well come here, take a seat",
      "start": 134.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 141.27999877929688,
      "text": "This could take a week, a lesson I have to teach",
      "start": 138.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 144.77999877929688,
      "text": "Gonna try not to preach, but you know how things go",
      "start": 141.47999572753906
    },
    {
      "end": 147.66000366210938,
      "text": "You can't ever grow, you'll never know the wisdom you take",
      "start": 144.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 152.25999450683594,
      "text": "I'm experienced, it's a requirement, no you don't get em all again",
      "start": 148
    },
    {
      "end": 155.5,
      "text": "We're not just average hooligans, stop with all the foolishness",
      "start": 152.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 158.25999450683594,
      "text": "You make no sense, they'll come and claim their recompense",
      "start": 155.5
    },
    {
      "end": 161.25999450683594,
      "text": "Through the apocalypse, through the warm eclipse, this is it",
      "start": 158.25999450683594
    },
    {
      "end": 170.39999389648438,
      "text": "I can feel my airwaves, getting crushed in the water waves, lost in your undertow",
      "start": 163.83999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 176.66000366210938,
      "text": "I can feel my airwaves, getting crushed in the water waves, lost in your undertow",
      "start": 170.39999389648438
    },
    {
      "end": 180.83999633789062,
      "text": "Baby surfing through the airwaves, see my brain going insane",
      "start": 176.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 183.9600067138672,
      "text": "Love is like a drug coursing through the main vein",
      "start": 180.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 189,
      "text": "We can never be the same, never be the same again",
      "start": 183.9600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 194.6999969482422,
      "text": "And now you tell me you don't want to talk to me",
      "start": 190.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 199,
      "text": "Gonna leave me out in the cold",
      "start": 194.75999450683594
